        </style><div xmlns="" class="content_block"><h2 class="auth__title">Какие меры ответственности предусмотрены за нарушение трудового законодательства и прав работников</h2><div class="doc-snippet"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfaseqprso/" data-dfa="dfaseqprso"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr2/"></a>Если нарушите трудовое законодательство, проверяющие оштрафуют должностных лиц организации. Размеры штрафов — в таблице. </div><div id="documentBody" class="content-common"><div><div class="table-wide scroller-wrapper"><div class="scroller table-scroller"><div class="scroller__container"><table width="100.00%"><caption></caption><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3" style="width: 20.68%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr6/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasd8v0dq/" data-dfa="dfasd8v0dq"></a><strong>Вид нарушения</strong></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" colspan="4" style="width: 58.9%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr7/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfast1wsu9/" data-dfa="dfast1wsu9"></a><strong>Административная мера наказания / БРВ</strong></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" rowspan="3" style="width: 16.21%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr8/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfaswpala1/" data-dfa="dfaswpala1"></a><strong>Основание</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 21.7%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr9/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasfgrilt/" data-dfa="dfasfgrilt"></a>Однократное</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 21%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasut9gr1/" data-dfa="dfasut9gr1"></a>Повторное в течении года</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr11/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasoq3p7i/" data-dfa="dfasoq3p7i"></a>Граждане</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr12/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasath29w/" data-dfa="dfasath29w"></a>Должностные лица</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr13/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasxhglpk/" data-dfa="dfasxhglpk"></a>Граждане</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr14/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasxtckho/" data-dfa="dfasxtckho"></a>Должностные лица</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width: 20.68%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr15/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasdzvnqi/" data-dfa="dfasdzvnqi"></a>Нарушение законодательства о персональных данных</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr16/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasyzgmfa/" data-dfa="dfasyzgmfa"></a>7</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr17/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasikgqp7/" data-dfa="dfasikgqp7"></a>50</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas7tdsg5/" data-dfa="dfas7tdsg5"></a>-&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasau7d3a/" data-dfa="dfasau7d3a"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr20/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas8gx0dg/" data-dfa="dfas8gx0dg"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor1/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfas8d7khb/" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21178" anchor="dfas8d7khb">Ст.&nbsp;46-2</a> КоАО</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width: 20.68%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas13ieeb/" data-dfa="dfas13ieeb"></a>Нарушение законодательства о&nbsp;труде и&nbsp;охране труда</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr22/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas1zzy7l/" data-dfa="dfas1zzy7l"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr23/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfaszm61h5/" data-dfa="dfaszm61h5"></a>от&nbsp;5&nbsp;до&nbsp;10</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr24/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfascvn6sd/" data-dfa="dfascvn6sd"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr25/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfaswhvmmg/" data-dfa="dfaswhvmmg"></a>от&nbsp;10&nbsp;до&nbsp;15</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr26/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasapk8mx/" data-dfa="dfasapk8mx"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor2/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfaspw5dil/" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21178" anchor="dfaspw5dil">Ст.&nbsp;49</a>&nbsp;КоАО</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width: 20.68%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr27/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasxy32gx/" data-dfa="dfasxy32gx"></a>Нарушение законодательства о труде и охране труда в отношении несовершеннолетнего</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr28/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfaskkegxa/" data-dfa="dfaskkegxa"></a>-&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr29/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfase9trxm/" data-dfa="dfase9trxm"></a>от 10 до 20</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr30/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas9nbnw9/" data-dfa="dfas9nbnw9"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr31/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfaseue5i7/" data-dfa="dfaseue5i7"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr32/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasgargu8/" data-dfa="dfasgargu8"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor30/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfaspw5dil/" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21178" anchor="dfaspw5dil">Ст. 49</a> КоАО</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width: 20.68%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr33/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasy5wnrm/" data-dfa="dfasy5wnrm"></a>Нарушение требований о&nbsp;недопустимости использования труда несовершеннолетних</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr34/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasi9hnr4/" data-dfa="dfasi9hnr4"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr35/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas4ew7z8/" data-dfa="dfas4ew7z8"></a>&nbsp;от 10 до 20</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr36/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasokf0dg/" data-dfa="dfasokf0dg"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr37/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfash6yslx/" data-dfa="dfash6yslx"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr38/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas1auiar/" data-dfa="dfas1auiar"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor3/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfas824sip/" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21178" anchor="dfas824sip">Ст.&nbsp;49-1</a> КоАО</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width: 20.68%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr39/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasaszf35/" data-dfa="dfasaszf35"></a>Невыполнение требований законодательства об&nbsp;обязательном страховании гражданской ответственности работодателя</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr40/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasv0hpv7/" data-dfa="dfasv0hpv7"></a>от&nbsp;7&nbsp;до&nbsp;10</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr41/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasmvf9yw/" data-dfa="dfasmvf9yw"></a>от&nbsp;10&nbsp;до&nbsp;15</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr42/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasm91syb/" data-dfa="dfasm91syb"></a>от&nbsp;10&nbsp;до&nbsp;15</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr43/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasq5ft26/" data-dfa="dfasq5ft26"></a>от&nbsp;15&nbsp;до&nbsp;30</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr44/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasws9xh5/" data-dfa="dfasws9xh5"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor4/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfasgv7mxw/" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21178" anchor="dfasgv7mxw">Ст.&nbsp;49-2</a> КоАО</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width: 20.68%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr45/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasbhpeh5/" data-dfa="dfasbhpeh5"></a>Уклонение от&nbsp;обязанности по&nbsp;выплате пособий по&nbsp;временной нетрудоспособности, беременности и&nbsp;родам</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr46/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas433a52/" data-dfa="dfas433a52"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr47/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas5hctcq/" data-dfa="dfas5hctcq"></a>от&nbsp;10&nbsp;до&nbsp;15</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr48/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas3snmz7/" data-dfa="dfas3snmz7"></a>-&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr49/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasb3t6b2/" data-dfa="dfasb3t6b2"></a>от&nbsp;15&nbsp;до&nbsp;30</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr50/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasgy3c2k/" data-dfa="dfasgy3c2k"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor5/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfask56grs/" data-warm-notices="15603193" data-warm-notice-type="error" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21178" anchor="dfask56grs">Ст.&nbsp;49-3 </a>КоАО</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width: 20.68%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr51/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasgstyex/" data-dfa="dfasgstyex"></a>Нарушение порядка привлечения и&nbsp;использования иностранных работников</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr52/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas6ec28g/" data-dfa="dfas6ec28g"></a>от&nbsp;5&nbsp;до&nbsp;10</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr53/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasr9vble/" data-dfa="dfasr9vble"></a>от&nbsp;10&nbsp;до&nbsp;25</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr54/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasmdhlag/" data-dfa="dfasmdhlag"></a>от&nbsp;10&nbsp;до&nbsp;15</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr55/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfaslwn2if/" data-dfa="dfaslwn2if"></a>от&nbsp;25&nbsp;до&nbsp;50</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr56/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas1agd5t/" data-dfa="dfas1agd5t"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor6/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfasxfeb53/" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" docume