м органов по&nbsp;труду</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr64/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasvncfk3/" data-dfa="dfasvncfk3"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr65/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasfdbzsd/" data-dfa="dfasfdbzsd"></a>от&nbsp;10&nbsp;до&nbsp;20</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr66/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas721q61/" data-dfa="dfas721q61"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr67/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasir0ip8/" data-dfa="dfasir0ip8"></a>от&nbsp;20&nbsp;до&nbsp;30</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr68/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasazvyel/" data-dfa="dfasazvyel"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor8/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfasyzyhga/" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21178" anchor="dfasyzyhga">Ст.&nbsp;50</a>&nbsp;КоАО</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width: 20.68%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr69/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasgbwgid/" data-dfa="dfasgbwgid"></a>Необоснованный отказ для трудоустройства в&nbsp;счет установленного минимального количества рабочих мест</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr70/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasc6t9cz/" data-dfa="dfasc6t9cz"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr71/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfaswgsnms/" data-dfa="dfaswgsnms"></a>от&nbsp;10&nbsp;до&nbsp;20</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr72/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasniw409/" data-dfa="dfasniw409"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr73/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfask2ie68/" data-dfa="dfask2ie68"></a>от&nbsp;20&nbsp;до&nbsp;30</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr74/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas5usyn7/" data-dfa="dfas5usyn7"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor9/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfasyzyhga/" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21178" anchor="dfasyzyhga">Ст.&nbsp;50</a>&nbsp;КоАО</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width: 20.68%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr75/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasy2v6bg/" data-dfa="dfasy2v6bg"></a>Необоснованный отказ в&nbsp;приеме лиц, направленных органами по&nbsp;труду на&nbsp;профессиональную подготовку, переподготовку и&nbsp;повышение квалификации</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr76/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas7stitr/" data-dfa="dfas7stitr"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr77/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasyos42z/" data-dfa="dfasyos42z"></a>от&nbsp;10&nbsp;до&nbsp;20</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr78/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas49qwa0/" data-dfa="dfas49qwa0"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr79/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasu8sp3r/" data-dfa="dfasu8sp3r"></a>от&nbsp;20&nbsp;до&nbsp;30</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr80/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasw9iz0h/" data-dfa="dfasw9iz0h"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor10/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfasyzyhga/" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21178" anchor="dfasyzyhga">Ст.&nbsp;50</a>&nbsp;КоАО</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width: 20.68%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr81/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasfodtt4/" data-dfa="dfasfodtt4"></a>Административное принуждение к&nbsp;труду, за&nbsp;исключением случаев, предусмотренных законом</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr82/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasatiwps/" data-dfa="dfasatiwps"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr83/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasq4hwi4/" data-dfa="dfasq4hwi4"></a>от&nbsp;50&nbsp;до&nbsp;100</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr84/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas6xw5g8/" data-dfa="dfas6xw5g8"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr85/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasbngcev/" data-dfa="dfasbngcev"></a>&nbsp;-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr86/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas0px3a0/" data-dfa="dfas0px3a0"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor11/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfasa02dn3/" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21178" anchor="dfasa02dn3">Ст.&nbsp;51</a>&nbsp;КоАО</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width: 20.68%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr87/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasscada9/" data-dfa="dfasscada9"></a>Нарушение законодательства о&nbsp;социальной защищенности инвалидов</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 12.97%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr88/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfassse5n0/" data-dfa="dfassse5n0"></a>-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.9%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr89/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas60cckz/" data-dfa="dfas60cckz"></a>от&nbsp;10&nbsp;до&nbsp;15</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 13.58%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr90/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas8bl8q0/" data-dfa="dfas8bl8q0"></a>-</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 14.75%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr91/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfas38qncm/" data-dfa="dfas38qncm"></a>от&nbsp;15&nbsp;до&nbsp;30</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width: 16.21%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/bssPhr92/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/dfasb2n6sm/" data-dfa="dfasb2n6sm"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210319/backlinkanchor20/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21178/dfasrrtgic/" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21178" anchor="dfasrrtgic">Ст.&nbsp;51-1</a> КоАО</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" colspan="6" style="width: 98.3%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/doc